* Modular commutation-capacitance assembly for the P24 main-line model.
* Device Coss source: GS61008T datasheet Rev 200402 (external device data).
* Population source: P25 Table III (1 high-side, 2 parallel low-side devices).
* External snubber values are not published by P24/P25 and default to zero.
* Control thresholds and timing must be defined outside this component module.
.param NHS=1 NLS=2
.param CH_DEVICE={NHS*GS61008T_COTR_0_50V}
.param CL_DEVICE={NLS*GS61008T_COTR_0_50V}
.param CH_SNUBBER=0
.param CL_SNUBBER=0
.param CH_TOTAL={CH_DEVICE+CH_SNUBBER}
.param CL_TOTAL={CL_DEVICE+CL_SNUBBER}
